    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/AISM_0000376">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="genid2668"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The distance between two cuticular punctures.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232 xml:lang="en">Edited by jgiron https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0851-6883 
2024-05-11
To make it a distance as opposed to an anatomical space and change &apos;adjacent to&apos; for &apos;characteristic of&apos;
Matching existing definitions e.g. http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/AGRO_00000318

Former definition based on suggestions at https://github.com/obophenotype/uberon/issues/3188</obo:IAO_0000232>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">interpunctural distance</rdfs:label>
