        <obo:AISM_0000171 xml:lang="en">Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.

https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043

&quot;Clypeus: anteroventral part of head capsule; primarily separated from frons by transverse frontoclypeal strengthening ridge between anterior tentorial pits; usually bearing the labrum at its distal margin.&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


