&quot;Sternum: ventral wall of thoracic (or abdominal) segment, usually divided into presternum, basisternum, furcasternum and spinasternum in unspecialized hexapods; largely or completely invaginated in Holometabola (cryptosterny).&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


