        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">pleural ridge</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <obo:AISM_0000171 xml:lang="en">Beutel RG, Friedrich F, Yang X-K, Ge S-Q (2014) Insect Morphology and Phylogeny Insect morphology and phylogeny: a textbook for students of entomology. De Gruyter.

https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110264043

&quot;Pleural ridge: internal ridge, corresponding to externally visible pleural “suture”; separates episternum and epimeron; anterodorsally forming the pleural wing process and posteroventrally the pleuro-coxal joint.&quot;</obo:AISM_0000171>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


