        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tube or collection of tubes in an animal from the ovaries to the outside of the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000232>sometimes oviduct is used interchangeably with follaopian tube. Here they are different - the oviduct connects the gonad to the outside in a variety of animals. The mammal-class fallopian tube is derived from the mullerian duct and connects the gonads/infubdibulum to the uterus</obo:IAO_0000232>
